#: docs/silkie/window-actions.rst:2
msgid "Window actions"
msgstr "窗口操作"

#: docs/silkie/window-actions.rst:5
msgid "Kill an unresponsive window"
msgstr "终止无响应的窗口"

#: docs/silkie/window-actions.rst:7
msgid ""
"Silkie adds the ``kill_window`` action. It sends ``SIGKILL`` to the foreground process group and "
"to the shell, then closes the active terminal window. Use it when a program no longer responds; "
"the killed programs cannot save their state."
msgstr "Silkie 添加了 ``kill_window`` 操作。它向前台进程组和 shell 发送 ``SIGKILL``，然后关闭当前终端窗口。程序不再响应时可使用此操作；被终止的程序无法保存状态。"

