msgid "To bind the action in ``kitty.conf``::"
msgstr "在 ``kitty.conf`` 中绑定该操作：::"

#: docs/silkie/window-actions.rst:15
msgid ""
"On macOS, the Shell menu also provides **Kill Window**. For the mapping syntax and inherited "
"actions, see `kitty's keyboard mapping documentation "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/mapping/>`_."
msgstr ""
"macOS 的 Shell 菜单还提供 **Kill Window（终止窗口）**。映射语法和继承的操作见 `kitty 按键映射文档 "
"<https://sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/mapping/>`_。"

